{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a gaming assistant tool designed for gamers who love danmaku culture. Its features include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danmaku Notifications</strong><br>While you\u2019re gaming in full screen, Windows notifications will fly across your screen as danmaku \u2014 just like comments on your favorite streaming videos \u2014 so you never miss a message without leaving the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance Monitor</strong><br>Keep an eye on your PC\u2019s hardware status (CPU, GPU, RAM, etc.) in real-time while you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Chat Phrases</strong><br>Set up custom shortcut phrases to communicate instantly in-game \u2014 perfect for team coordination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Remapping(</strong>Tested with several games \u2014 some work, some don\u2019t. Occasionally, the software\u2019s approach may be detected as cheating/hacking tools by anti-cheat systems.<strong>)</strong><br>Customize your key bindings to unify controls across different games \u2014 one layout to rule them all!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015330?t=1760411012","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015330?t=1760411012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015330/5cbb93f31c7a6793006ee7da75f8fcbe93a0d0f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760411012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015330/5cbb93f31c7a6793006ee7da75f8fcbe93a0d0f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760411012","categories":[{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a gaming assistant tool designed for gamers who love danmaku culture. I